## TL;DR
Here’s a **complete, runnable GameMaker (GML 2.3+) vertical-slice** turn-based dream-roguelite: **mask selection → procedural rooms/corridors → move/attack/wait/cast → enemy chase AI → stairs to next floor → gate-pattern dice rolls (triples/doubles/straights) → dreamy guide-voice log + chantable “Haloic-ish” sigil name generator**.  
Mechanically it uses the **three-axis framing (Bamboo/Labyrinth/Halo)** fileciteturn1file0L1-L6, **pattern “Gates”** fileciteturn1file3L30-L40, **the Quadratic Core guide-voices** fileciteturn1file1L6-L39, and a **phoneme/chant vibe** fileciteturn1file2L1-L9—**without copying any tables verbatim**.

---

## Quick setup in GameMaker
1) Create **Room**: `rm_game`, size **1280x720**.  
2) Create **Object**: `obj_game`, place **one instance** in `rm_game`.  
3) Create **Script**: `prism_core` and paste the full code below.  
4) Wire `obj_game` events (paste the small event snippets included in the code block):
- **Create** → `prism_game_create();`
- **Step** → `prism_game_step();`
- **Draw** → `prism_game_draw();`
- **Draw GUI** → `prism_game_draw_gui();`
- **Game End** → `prism_game_destroy();`

Controls: **WASD/Arrows** move, **Space** wait, **Q** cast sigil, **R** restart on death, **1/2/3** choose mask.

---

## Build plan (pseudocode)
1) Define constants (map size, tile size, UI layout) and enums (tiles, states, phases, factions, gate patterns, voices).  
2) Build a `prism` game struct holding:
   - RNG seed base, current floor, biome, map grid  
   - entity array (player + enemies)  
   - turn-phase state machine  
   - log list, last gate roll, run currency + meta currency  
   - content defs (masks, biomes, enemies, sigils)  
3) Procedural dungeon:
   - fill walls → place non-overlapping rooms → connect centers with L-corridors  
   - place stairs in last room  
4) Entities:
   - player entity has axes + HP (Bamboo influences HP only in this slice)  
   - enemy entities have simple “hunter” AI  
5) Turn system:
   - PLAYER phase waits for one action (move/attack/wait/cast)  
   - ENEMIES phase processes one enemy per step  
   - WORLD_PULSE phase emits small dream flavor + rare spawns (lightweight)  
   - STATUS phase ticks cooldowns/status  
6) Gate system:
   - on enemy death, roll 3d6 mapped to axes  
   - detect triples/doubles/straights  
   - apply small rewards/side-effects (heal/shards/story pressure)  
7) Narrative layer:
   - emit guide voice lines at floor start, low HP, gate triggers  
8) Rendering:
   - draw ASCII-glyph grid + entities  
   - draw UI panel (axes/HP/floor/biome/log/controls)

---

```gml
/// [redacted:social-handle] scripts/prism_core.gml
/// [redacted:social-handle] PRISMATIC LABYRINTH (GML 2.3+) - turn-based dream roguelite vertical slice.
///
/// Project wiring:
/// - Room: rm_game (1280x720)
/// - Object: obj_game in rm_game
/// - obj_game events:
///   Create:    prism_game_create();
///   Step:      prism_game_step();
///   Draw:      prism_game_draw();
///   Draw GUI:  prism_game_draw_gui();
///   Game End:  prism_game_destroy();

#macro PRISM_ROOM_W 1280
#macro PRISM_ROOM_H 720

#macro PRISM_TILE 24
#macro PRISM_MAP_W 40
#macro PRISM_MAP_H 25
#macro PRISM_MAP_PX (PRISM_MAP_W * PRISM_TILE)
#macro PRISM_MAP_PY (PRISM_MAP_H * PRISM_TILE)

#macro PRISM_UI_X (PRISM_MAP_PX + 16)
#macro PRISM_UI_Y 16
#macro PRISM_LOG_X PRISM_UI_X
#macro PRISM_LOG_Y 260
#macro PRISM_LOG_LINE_H 18

enum PrismTile { WALL = 0, FLOOR = 1, STAIRS = 2 }
enum PrismState { PICK_MASK = 0, PLAY = 1, GAME_OVER = 2 }
enum PrismTurn { PLAYER = 0, ENEMIES = 1, WORLD_PULSE = 2, STATUS = 3 }
enum PrismFaction { PLAYER = 0, HOSTILE = 1, NEUTRAL = 2 }
enum PrismGatePattern { NONE = 0, TRIPLE = 1, DOUBLE = 2, STRAIGHT = 3 }
enum PrismVoice { SOLARIS = 0, LIRAEL = 1, MORGANA = 2, GG = 3 }

function prism_game_create() {
    window_set_size(PRISM_ROOM_W, PRISM_ROOM_H);
    display_set_gui_size(PRISM_ROOM_W, PRISM_ROOM_H);

    prism = prism_new_game();
    prism_log_add(prism, ">> Dream OS online. Select a Mask: [1] Root [2] Door [3] Crown");
}

function prism_game_destroy() {
    if (is_struct(prism)) {
        prism_meta_save(prism.meta);

        if (ds_exists(prism.map, ds_type_grid)) ds_grid_destroy(prism.map);
        if (ds_exists(prism.log, ds_type_list)) ds_list_destroy(prism.log);

        if (prism.font_mono != -1) font_delete(prism.font_mono);

        prism = undefined;
    }
}

function prism_game_step() {
    if (!is_struct(prism)) return;

    switch (prism.state) {
        case PrismState.PICK_MASK:
            prism_step_pick_mask(prism);
            break;
        case PrismState.PLAY:
            prism_step_play(prism);
            break;
        case PrismState.GAME_OVER:
            prism_step_game_over(prism);
            break;
    }
}

function prism_game_draw() {
    if (!is_struct(prism)) return;

    draw_clear(c_black);

    if (!ds_exists(prism.map, ds_type_grid)) return;

    draw_set_font(prism.font_mono);
    draw_set_halign(fa_left);
    draw_set_valign(fa_top);

    prism_draw_map(prism);
    prism_draw_entities(prism);
}

function prism_game_draw_gui() {
    if (!is_struct(prism)) return;

    draw_set_font(prism.font_mono);
    draw_set_halign(fa_left);
    draw_set_valign(fa_top);

    prism_draw_ui(prism);

    if (prism.state == PrismState.PICK_MASK) {
        prism_draw_mask_screen(prism);
    } else if (prism.state == PrismState.GAME_OVER) {
        prism_draw_game_over(prism);
    }
}

/* =========================
   Core State
   ========================= */

function prism_new_game() {
    var g = {
        title: "PRISMATIC LABYRINTH: Dream of the Empty Throne",

        state: PrismState.PICK_MASK,
        turn: PrismTurn.PLAYER,

        floor: 0,
        biome: undefined,

        rng_seed_base: irandom(2000000000),

        map_w: PRISM_MAP_W,
        map_h: PRISM_MAP_H,
        map: -1,

        entities: [],
        next_eid: 0,
        player_id: -1,
        enemy_ids: [],
        enemy_turn_i: 0,

        log: ds_list_create(),
        log_limit: 14,

        last_gate: undefined,
        run_shards: 0,
        story_pressure: 0,

        masks: prism_build_masks(),
        chosen_mask: -1,

        biomes: prism_build_biomes(),

        content_enemies: prism_build_enemy_defs(),
        content_sigils: prism_build_sigil_defs(),

        meta: prism_meta_load(),

        font_mono: prism_font_create()
    };

    return g;
}

function prism_step_pick_mask(g) {
    if (keyboard_check_pressed(ord("1"))) prism_start_run(g, 0);
    if (keyboard_check_pressed(ord("2"))) prism_start_run(g, 1);
    if (keyboard_check_pressed(ord("3"))) prism_start_run(g, 2);
}

function prism_step_play(g) {
    if (!prism_entity_exists(g, g.player_id)) {
        g.state = PrismState.GAME_OVER;
        prism_meta_commit_run(g);
        prism_log_add(g, ">> The dream unthreads. Press [R] to restart.");
        return;
    }

    switch (g.turn) {
        case PrismTurn.PLAYER:
            if (prism_player_take_input(g)) {
                g.turn = PrismTurn.ENEMIES;
                g.enemy_turn_i = 0;
            }
            break;

        case PrismTurn.ENEMIES:
            prism_enemy_phase_step(g);
            break;

        case PrismTurn.WORLD_PULSE:
            prism_world_pulse(g);
            g.turn = PrismTurn.STATUS;
            break;

        case PrismTurn.STATUS:
            prism_status_tick(g);
            g.turn = PrismTurn.PLAYER;
            break;
    }
}

function prism_step_game_over(g) {
    if (keyboard_check_pressed(ord("R"))) {
        prism_reset_to_mask_select(g);
    }
}

function prism_reset_to_mask_select(g) {
    if (ds_exists(g.map, ds_type_grid)) ds_grid_destroy(g.map);
    g.map = -1;

    g.entities = [];
    g.enemy_ids = [];
    g.player_id = -1;
    g.next_eid = 0;

    g.floor = 0;
    g.run_shards = 0;
    g.story_pressure = 0;
    g.last_gate = undefined;

    g.state = PrismState.PICK_MASK;
    g.turn = PrismTurn.PLAYER;

    ds_list_clear(g.log);
    prism_log_add(g, ">> Dream OS rebooted. Select a Mask: [1] Root [2] Door [3] Crown");
}

/* =========================
   Meta (simple INI)
   ========================= */

function prism_meta_load() {
    var m = { shards_total: 0 };

    if (file_exists("prism_meta.ini")) {
        ini_open("prism_meta.ini");
        m.shards_total = ini_read_real("meta", "shards_total", 0);
        ini_close();
    }
    return m;
}

function prism_meta_save(m) {
    ini_open("prism_meta.ini");
    ini_write_real("meta", "shards_total", m.shards_total);
    ini_close();
}

function prism_meta_commit_run(g) {
    g.meta.shards_total += g.run_shards;
    prism_meta_save(g.meta);
}

/* =========================
   Content
   ========================= */

function prism_build_masks() {
    return [
        {
            id: "MASK_ROOT",
            name: "Rooted Mask",
            subtitle: "The animal truth that survives the fog.",
            bamboo: 4, labyrinth: 2, halo: 1,
            hp_max: 14,
            sigil_id: "SIGIL_SOFT_RESET"
        },
        {
            id: "MASK_DOOR",
            name: "Doorwright Mask",
            subtitle: "The hinge that decides the world’s answer.",
            bamboo: 3, labyrinth: 4, halo: 1,
            hp_max: 12,
            sigil_id: "SIGIL_SOFT_RESET"
        },
        {
            id: "MASK_CROWN",
            name: "Crownless Mask",
            subtitle: "The vow that burns brighter than luck.",
            bamboo: 2, labyrinth: 2, halo: 4,
            hp_max: 10,
            sigil_id: "SIGIL_SOFT_RESET"
        }
    ];
}

function prism_build_biomes() {
    return [
        {
            id: "BIO_FOG_GARDEN",
            name: "Fog Garden",
            glyph_wall: "#",
            glyph_floor: ".",
            glyph_stairs: ">",
            spawn_enemy_ids: ["EN_WISP", "EN_THORNLET"],
            pulse_spawn_chance: 0.02
        },
        {
            id: "BIO_MIRROR_HALL",
            name: "Mirror Hall",
            glyph_wall: "▓",
            glyph_floor: "·",
            glyph_stairs: "»",
            spawn_enemy_ids: ["EN_WISP", "EN_SENTINEL"],
            pulse_spawn_chance: 0.03
        },
        {
            id: "BIO_LANTERN_ARCHIVE",
            name: "Lantern Archive",
            glyph_wall: "▒",
            glyph_floor: ",",
            glyph_stairs: "⇣",
            spawn_enemy_ids: ["EN_SENTINEL", "EN_THORNLET"],
            pulse_spawn_chance: 0.015
        }
    ];
}

function prism_build_enemy_defs() {
    return [
        {
            id: "EN_WISP",
            name: "Friction Wisp",
            glyph: "g",
            ai_kind: "hunter",
            bamboo: 1, labyrinth: 1, halo: 1,
            hp: 3
        },
        {
            id: "EN_THORNLET",
            name: "Thornlet",
            glyph: "t",
            ai_kind: "hunter",
            bamboo: 2, labyrinth: 1, halo: 0,
            hp: 4
        },
        {
            id: "EN_SENTINEL",
            name: "Quiet Sentinel",
            glyph: "S",
            ai_kind: "hunter",
            bamboo: 2, labyrinth: 2, halo: 1,
            hp: 5
        }
    ];
}

function prism_build_sigil_defs() {
    return [
        {
            id: "SIGIL_SOFT_RESET",
            name_seed: "soft-reset",
            tags: ["CALM", "RESTORE", "SPIRIT"],
            cooldown: 5,
            power: 2,
            effect: "HEAL_SELF"
        }
    ];
}

function prism_enemy_def_by_id(g, id) {
    var defs = g.content_enemies;
    var n = array_length_1d(defs);
    for (var i = 0; i < n; i++) {
        if (defs[i].id == id) return defs[i];
    }
    return defs[0];
}

function prism_sigil_def_by_id(g, id) {
    var defs = g.content_sigils;
    var n = array_length_1d(defs);
    for (var i = 0; i < n; i++) {
        if (defs[i].id == id) return defs[i];
    }
    return defs[0];
}

/* =========================
   Run / Floor
   ========================= */

function prism_start_run(g, mask_index) {
    g.chosen_mask = mask_index;
    g.state = PrismState.PLAY;
    g.turn = PrismTurn.PLAYER;

    g.floor = 0;
    g.run_shards = 0;
    g.story_pressure = 0;
    g.last_gate = undefined;

    ds_list_clear(g.log);

    var mask = g.masks[mask_index];
    prism_log_add(g, ">> Mask equipped: " + mask.name);
    prism_log_add(g, ">> " + mask.subtitle);

    prism_next_floor(g);
}

function prism_next_floor(g) {
    g.floor += 1;

    var carry = prism_player_snapshot(g);

    var seed = g.rng_seed_base + (g.floor * 1337);
    random_set_seed(seed);

    if (ds_exists(g.map, ds_type_grid)) ds_grid_destroy(g.map);
    g.map = ds_grid_create(g.map_w, g.map_h);
    ds_grid_clear(g.map, PrismTile.WALL);

    g.entities = [];
    g.enemy_ids = [];
    g.player_id = -1;
    g.next_eid = 0;

    g.biome = g.biomes[irandom(array_length_1d(g.biomes) - 1)];

    var rooms = prism_dungeon_carve(g, 32, 5, 10);

    var start_room = rooms[0];
    var end_room = rooms[array_length_1d(rooms) - 1];

    ds_grid_set(g.map, end_room.cx, end_room.cy, PrismTile.STAIRS);

    prism_spawn_player(g, start_room.cx, start_room.cy, carry);

    prism_spawn_enemies_for_rooms(g, rooms);

    prism_narrative_floor_start(g);
    prism_log_add(g, ">> Floor " + string(g.floor) + " — " + g.biome.name);
}

function prism_player_snapshot(g) {
    if (!prism_entity_exists(g, g.player_id)) return undefined;

    var e = g.entities[g.player_id];
    return {
        bamboo: e.stats.bamboo,
        labyrinth: e.stats.labyrinth,
        halo: e.stats.halo,
        hp: e.stats.hp,
        hp_max: e.stats.hp_max,
        sigil_id: e.sigil_id,
        sigil_cd: e.sigil_cd
    };
}

function prism_spawn_player(g, x, y, carry) {
    var mask = g.masks[g.chosen_mask];

    var bamboo = mask.bamboo;
    var labyrinth = mask.labyrinth;
    var halo = mask.halo;
    var hp_max = mask.hp_max;
    var hp = hp_max;
    var sigil_id = mask.sigil_id;
    var sigil_cd = 0;

    if (is_struct(carry)) {
        bamboo = carry.bamboo;
        labyrinth = carry.labyrinth;
        halo = carry.halo;
        hp_max = carry.hp_max;
        hp = min(carry.hp, hp_max);
        sigil_id = carry.sigil_id;
        sigil_cd = max(0, carry.sigil_cd);
    }

    var id = prism_entity_create(g, {
        name: "Dreamer",
        faction: PrismFaction.PLAYER,
        pos: { x: x, y: y },
        render: { glyph: "@" },
        blocks: true,
        stats: {
            bamboo: bamboo,
            labyrinth: labyrinth,
            halo: halo,
            hp: hp,
            hp_max: hp_max
        },
        sigil_id: sigil_id,
        sigil_cd: sigil_cd
    });

    g.player_id = id;
}

function prism_spawn_enemies_for_rooms(g, rooms) {
    var rcount = array_length_1d(rooms);
    for (var ri = 1; ri < rcount; ri++) {
        var r = rooms[ri];
        var spawns = irandom_range(0, 2);

        for (var k = 0; k < spawns; k++) {
            var tries = 20;
            while (tries > 0) {
                tries -= 1;

                var ex = irandom_range(r.x1, r.x2);
                var ey = irandom_range(r.y1, r.y2);

                if (!prism_is_walkable(g, ex, ey)) continue;
                if (prism_blocking_entity_at(g, ex, ey) != -1) continue;

                var enemy_pool = g.biome.spawn_enemy_ids;
                var def_id = enemy_pool[irandom(array_length_1d(enemy_pool) - 1)];
                prism_spawn_enemy(g, ex, ey, def_id);
                break;
            }
        }
    }

    if (array_length_1d(g.enemy_ids) < 3) {
        var placed = 0;
        while (placed < 3) {
            var rx = irandom(g.map_w - 1);
            var ry = irandom(g.map_h - 1);
            if (!prism_is_walkable(g, rx, ry)) continue;
            if (prism_blocking_entity_at(g, rx, ry) != -1) continue;

            var enemy_pool2 = g.biome.spawn_enemy_ids;
            var def2 = enemy_pool2[irandom(array_length_1d(enemy_pool2) - 1)];
            prism_spawn_enemy(g, rx, ry, def2);

            placed += 1;
            if (array_length_1d(g.enemy_ids) >= 3) break;
        }
    }
}

function prism_spawn_enemy(g, x, y, def_id) {
    var def = prism_enemy_def_by_id(g, def_id);

    var id = prism_entity_create(g, {
        name: def.name,
        faction: PrismFaction.HOSTILE,
        pos: { x: x, y: y },
        render: { glyph: def.glyph },
        blocks: true,
        stats: {
            bamboo: def.bamboo,
            labyrinth: def.labyrinth,
            halo: def.halo,
            hp: def.hp,
            hp_max: def.hp
        },
        ai: {
            kind: def.ai_kind,
            state: "seek"
        }
    });

    g.enemy_ids = prism_arr_push(g.enemy_ids, id);
    return id;
}

/* =========================
   Dungeon Gen
   ========================= */

function prism_dungeon_carve(g, attempts, room_min, room_max) {
    var rooms = [];

    for (var i = 0; i < attempts; i++) {
        var w = irandom_range(room_min, room_max);
        var h = irandom_range(room_min, room_max);

        var x1 = irandom_range(1, g.map_w - w - 2);
        var y1 = irandom_range(1, g.map_h - h - 2);
        var x2 = x1 + w - 1;
        var y2 = y1 + h - 1;

        var room = {
            x1: x1, y1: y1,
            x2: x2, y2: y2,
            cx: x1 + floor(w / 2),
            cy: y1 + floor(h / 2)
        };

        var ok = true;
        var n = array_length_1d(rooms);
        for (var r = 0; r < n; r++) {
            if (prism_room_intersects(room, rooms[r])) {
                ok = false;
                break;
            }
        }

        if (!ok) continue;

        prism_carve_room(g, room);

        if (n > 0) {
            var prev = rooms[n - 1];
            prism_carve_corridor(g, prev.cx, prev.cy, room.cx, room.cy);
        }

        rooms = prism_arr_push(rooms, room);
    }

    if (array_length_1d(rooms) < 2) {
        var fallback = {
            x1: 2, y1: 2,
            x2: min(g.map_w - 3, 14),
            y2: min(g.map_h - 3, 10),
            cx: 8, cy: 6
        };
        fallback.cx = floor((fallback.x1 + fallback.x2) * 0.5);
        fallback.cy = floor((fallback.y1 + fallback.y2) * 0.5);

        prism_carve_room(g, fallback);
        rooms = [fallback];
    }

    return rooms;
}

function prism_room_intersects(a, b) {
    var ax1 = a.x1 - 1;
    var ay1 = a.y1 - 1;
    var ax2 = a.x2 + 1;
    var ay2 = a.y2 + 1;

    return !(ax2 < b.x1 || ax1 > b.x2 || ay2 < b.y1 || ay1 > b.y2);
}

function prism_carve_room(g, room) {
    for (var y = room.y1; y <= room.y2; y++) {
        for (var x = room.x1; x <= room.x2; x++) {
            ds_grid_set(g.map, x, y, PrismTile.FLOOR);
        }
    }
}

function prism_carve_corridor(g, x1, y1, x2, y2) {
    if (irandom(1) == 0) {
        prism_carve_hline(g, x1, x2, y1);
        prism_carve_vline(g, y1, y2, x2);
    } else {
        prism_carve_vline(g, y1, y2, x1);
        prism_carve_hline(g, x1, x2, y2);
    }
}

function prism_carve_hline(g, x1, x2, y) {
    var start = min(x1, x2);
    var stop = max(x1, x2);
    for (var x = start; x <= stop; x++) {
        ds_grid_set(g.map, x, y, PrismTile.FLOOR);
    }
}

function prism_carve_vline(g, y1, y2, x) {
    var start = min(y1, y2);
    var stop = max(y1, y2);
    for (var y = start; y <= stop; y++) {
        ds_grid_set(g.map, x, y, PrismTile.FLOOR);
    }
}

/* =========================
   Entities / Queries
   ========================= */

function prism_entity_create(g, proto) {
    var id = g.next_eid;
    g.next_eid += 1;

    var e = {
        id: id,
        alive: true,
        name: proto.name,
        faction: proto.faction,
        pos: proto.pos,
        render: proto.render,
        blocks: proto.blocks,
        stats: proto.stats
    };

    if (variable_struct_exists(proto, "ai")) e.ai = proto.ai;
    if (variable_struct_exists(proto, "sigil_id")) e.sigil_id = proto.sigil_id;
    if (variable_struct_exists(proto, "sigil_cd")) e.sigil_cd = proto.sigil_cd;

    g.entities[id] = e;
    return id;
}

function prism_entity_exists(g, id) {
    if (id < 0) return false;
    if (id >= array_length_1d(g.entities)) return false;
    var e = g.entities[id];
    return is_struct(e) && e.alive;
}

function prism_blocking_entity_at(g, x, y) {
    var n = array_length_1d(g.entities);
    for (var i = 0; i < n; i++) {
        var e = g.entities[i];
        if (!is_struct(e)) continue;
        if (!e.alive) continue;
        if (!e.blocks) continue;
        if (e.pos.x == x && e.pos.y == y) return e.id;
    }
    return -1;
}

function prism_is_walkable(g, x, y) {
    if (x < 0 || y < 0 || x >= g.map_w || y >= g.map_h) return false;
    var t = ds_grid_get(g.map, x, y);
    return (t != PrismTile.WALL);
}

/* =========================
   Turn Actions
   ========================= */

function prism_player_take_input(g) {
    var pid = g.player_id;
    if (!prism_entity_exists(g, pid)) return false;

    if (keyboard_check_pressed(ord("Q"))) {
        return prism_player_cast_sigil(g);
    }

    var dx = 0;
    var dy = 0;

    if (keyboard_check_pressed(vk_left) || keyboard_check_pressed(ord("A"))) dx = -1;
    else if (keyboard_check_pressed(vk_right) || keyboard_check_pressed(ord("D"))) dx = 1;
    else if (keyboard_check_pressed(vk_up) || keyboard_check_pressed(ord("W"))) dy = -1;
    else if (keyboard_check_pressed(vk_down) || keyboard_check_pressed(ord("S"))) dy = 1;

    if (dx != 0 || dy != 0) {
        return prism_actor_try_move(g, pid, dx, dy);
    }

    if (keyboard_check_pressed(vk_space)) {
        prism_log_add(g, "You wait. The labyrinth inhales.");
        return true;
    }

    return false;
}

function prism_player_cast_sigil(g) {
    var p = g.entities[g.player_id];
    if (!variable_struct_exists(p, "sigil_id")) return false;

    if (p.sigil_cd > 0) {
        prism_log_add(g, "Sigil cooling (" + string(p.sigil_cd) + ").");
        return false;
    }

    var sig = prism_sigil_def_by_id(g, p.sigil_id);

    var chant = prism_sigil_name_generate(sig.tags);
    prism_log_add(g, "You intone: " + chant);

    if (sig.effect == "HEAL_SELF") {
        var healed = sig.power;
        p.stats.hp = min(p.stats.hp + healed, p.stats.hp_max);
        p.sigil_cd = sig.cooldown;

        prism_log_add(g, "Warm light stitches your nerves. +" + string(healed) + " HP.");
        return true;
    }

    prism_log_add(g, "Nothing answers. (Sigil stub)");
    p.sigil_cd = sig.cooldown;
    return true;
}

function prism_actor_try_move(g, actor_id, dx, dy) {
    var a = g.entities[actor_id];
    var nx = a.pos.x + dx;
    var ny = a.pos.y + dy;

    if (!prism_is_walkable(g, nx, ny)) return false;

    var blocker = prism_blocking_entity_at(g, nx, ny);
    if (blocker != -1 && blocker != actor_id) {
        return prism_melee_attack(g, actor_id, blocker);
    }

    a.pos.x = nx;
    a.pos.y = ny;

    if (a.faction == PrismFaction.PLAYER) {
        var tile = ds_grid_get(g.map, nx, ny);
        if (tile == PrismTile.STAIRS) {
            prism_log_add(g, ">> Threshold crossed. The floor rewrites itself.");
            prism_next_floor(g);
        }
    }

    return true;
}

function prism_melee_attack(g, attacker_id, target_id) {
    if (!prism_entity_exists(g, attacker_id)) return false;
    if (!prism_entity_exists(g, target_id)) return false;

    var a = g.entities[attacker_id];
    var t = g.entities[target_id];

    var dmg = 1;

    t.stats.hp -= dmg;
    prism_log_add(g, a.name + " strikes " + t.name + " (-" + string(dmg) + ").");

    if (t.stats.hp <= 0) {
        prism_kill_entity(g, target_id, attacker_id);
    }

    if (a.faction == PrismFaction.PLAYER && a.stats.hp <= 3) {
        prism_narrative_low_hp(g);
    }

    return true;
}

function prism_kill_entity(g, target_id, killer_id) {
    var t = g.entities[target_id];
    t.alive = false;

    prism_log_add(g, t.name + " dissolves into glittering dust.");

    if (t.faction == PrismFaction.HOSTILE) {
        g.enemy_ids = prism_arr_remove_value(g.enemy_ids, target_id);
        prism_on_enemy_killed(g, killer_id, target_id);
    }

    if (t.faction == PrismFaction.PLAYER) {
        g.state = PrismState.GAME_OVER;
        prism_meta_commit_run(g);
        prism_log_add(g, ">> You fall. The Empty Throne remains empty.");
        prism_log_add(g, ">> Press [R] to restart.");
    }
}

/* =========================
   Enemy AI
   ========================= */

function prism_enemy_phase_step(g) {
    var n = array_length_1d(g.enemy_ids);

    while (g.enemy_turn_i < n) {
        var eid = g.enemy_ids[g.enemy_turn_i];
        g.enemy_turn_i += 1;

        if (!prism_entity_exists(g, eid)) continue;

        prism_ai_take_turn(g, eid);
        return;
    }

    g.turn = PrismTurn.WORLD_PULSE;
}

function prism_ai_take_turn(g, enemy_id) {
    if (!prism_entity_exists(g, enemy_id)) return;

    var e = g.entities[enemy_id];
    var p = g.entities[g.player_id];

    var dx = p.pos.x - e.pos.x;
    var dy = p.pos.y - e.pos.y;

    var adx = abs(dx);
    var ady = abs(dy);

    if (adx + ady == 1) {
        prism_melee_attack(g, enemy_id, g.player_id);
        return;
    }

    var step_x = 0;
    var step_y = 0;

    if (adx > ady) step_x = sign(dx);
    else if (ady > 0) step_y = sign(dy);
    else step_x = sign(dx);

    if (!prism_actor_try_move(g, enemy_id, step_x, step_y)) {
        if (step_x != 0 && dy != 0) prism_actor_try_move(g, enemy_id, 0, sign(dy));
        else if (step_y != 0 && dx != 0) prism_actor_try_move(g, enemy_id, sign(dx), 0);
    }
}

/* =========================
   World Pulse / Status
   ========================= */

function prism_world_pulse(g) {
    if (!is_struct(g.biome)) return;

    if (random(1) < g.biome.pulse_spawn_chance) {
        var tries = 60;
        while (tries > 0) {
            tries -= 1;

            var x = irandom(g.map_w - 1);
            var y = irandom(g.map_h - 1);

            if (!prism_is_walkable(g, x, y)) continue;
            if (prism_blocking_entity_at(g, x, y) != -1) continue;

            var pool = g.biome.spawn_enemy_ids;
            var def_id = pool[irandom(array_length_1d(pool) - 1)];
            prism_spawn_enemy(g, x, y, def_id);

            prism_log_add(g, "The fog condenses into a new problem.");
            break;
        }
    }
}

function prism_status_tick(g) {
    if (!prism_entity_exists(g, g.player_id)) return;

    var p = g.entities[g.player_id];

    if (variable_struct_exists(p, "sigil_cd") && p.sigil_cd > 0) p.sigil_cd -= 1;

    if (p.stats.hp <= floor(p.stats.hp_max * 0.25)) g.story_pressure += 1;
    else g.story_pressure = max(0, g.story_pressure - 1);
}

/* =========================
   Gates (pattern dice)
   ========================= */

function prism_on_enemy_killed(g, killer_id, dead_id) {
    var gate = prism_gate_roll();
    g.last_gate = gate;

    var p = g.entities[g.player_id];

    switch (gate.pattern) {
        case PrismGatePattern.TRIPLE:
            g.run_shards += 3;
            p.stats.hp = min(p.stats.hp + 2, p.stats.hp_max);
            prism_log_add(g, "GATE: Resonance! Shards +3, HP +2.");
            prism_narrative_gate(g, gate);
            break;

        case PrismGatePattern.DOUBLE:
            g.run_shards += 1;
            if (gate.odd_axis == "B") {
                p.stats.hp = min(p.stats.hp + 1, p.stats.hp_max);
                prism_log_add(g, "GATE: Body shouts. HP +1, Shards +1.");
            } else if (gate.odd_axis == "L") {
                prism_log_add(g, "GATE: World shouts. Shards +2.");
                g.run_shards += 1;
            } else {
                prism_log_add(g, "GATE: Story shouts. Pressure -1, Shards +1.");
                g.story_pressure = max(0, g.story_pressure - 1);
            }
            prism_narrative_gate(g, gate);
            break;

        case PrismGatePattern.STRAIGHT:
            g.run_shards += 2;
            g.story_pressure += 1;
            prism_log_add(g, "GATE: Turning pattern. Shards +2, Pressure +1.");
            prism_narrative_gate(g, gate);
            break;

        default:
            if (irandom(1) == 1) g.run_shards += 1;
            break;
    }
}

function prism_gate_roll() {
    var b = irandom_range(1, 6);
    var l = irandom_range(1, 6);
    var h = irandom_range(1, 6);

    var pattern = PrismGatePattern.NONE;
    var odd_axis = "";

    if (b == l && l == h) {
        pattern = PrismGatePattern.TRIPLE;
    } else if (b == l || b == h || l == h) {
        pattern = PrismGatePattern.DOUBLE;

        if (b == l && h != b) odd_axis = "H";
        else if (b == h && l != b) odd_axis = "L";
        else if (l == h && b != l) odd_axis = "B";
    } else {
        var sorted = prism_sort3(b, l, h);
        if (sorted[0] + 1 == sorted[1] && sorted[1] + 1 == sorted[2]) {
            pattern = PrismGatePattern.STRAIGHT;
        }
    }

    return {
        b: b,
        l: l,
        h: h,
        total: b + l + h,
        pattern: pattern,
        odd_axis: odd_axis
    };
}

function prism_sort3(a, b, c) {
    var x = a;
    var y = b;
    var z = c;

    if (x > y) { var t = x; x = y; y = t; }
    if (y > z) { var t2 = y; y = z; z = t2; }
    if (x > y) { var t3 = x; x = y; y = t3; }

    return [x, y, z];
}

/* =========================
   Narrative (guides)
   ========================= */

function prism_narrative_floor_start(g) {
    var v = irandom(3);
    var line = "";

    switch (v) {
        case PrismVoice.SOLARIS:
            line = "Parameters stable. Expect pursuit. Favor clean angles.";
            break;
        case PrismVoice.LIRAEL:
            line = "A hallway remembers you. Walk gently—some doors bruise.";
            break;
        case PrismVoice.MORGANA:
            line = "If it costs your spine, it’s not a bargain. Break the hinge.";
            break;
        default:
            line = "lol new floor. don’t lick the mirrors. (unless you commit.)";
            break;
    }

    prism_voice_say(g, v, line);
}

function prism_narrative_low_hp(g) {
    var roll = irandom(2);
    if (roll == 0) prism_voice_say(g, PrismVoice.MORGANA, "No heroics. Survive first. Then rewrite the myth.");
    if (roll == 1) prism_voice_say(g, PrismVoice.LIRAEL, "Breathe. The maze is loud but not infinite.");
    if (roll == 2) prism_voice_say(g, PrismVoice.GG, "HP check bestie. maybe stop face-tanking the universe?");
}

function prism_narrative_gate(g, gate) {
    var v = irandom(3);

    if (gate.pattern == PrismGatePattern.TRIPLE) {
        if (v == PrismVoice.SOLARIS) prism_voice_say(g, v, "Resonance detected. Repeatable advantage—exploit calmly.");
        else if (v == PrismVoice.LIRAEL) prism_voice_say(g, v, "Three notes align. A hidden ladder appears in the air.");
        else if (v == PrismVoice.MORGANA) prism_voice_say(g, v, "Take the power. Pay nothing you didn’t choose.");
        else prism_voice_say(g, v, "triple?? ok that’s spicy. loot goblin approves.");
        return;
    }

    if (gate.pattern == PrismGatePattern.DOUBLE) {
        prism_voice_say(g, v, "Two echoes match. One axis refuses the script.");
        return;
    }

    if (gate.pattern == PrismGatePattern.STRAIGHT) {
        prism_voice_say(g, v, "A clean sequence. The dream wants a bigger question.");
        return;
    }
}

function prism_voice_say(g, voice, text) {
    prism_log_add(g, "[" + prism_voice_name(voice) + "] " + text);
}

function prism_voice_name(voice) {
    switch (voice) {
        case PrismVoice.SOLARIS: return "Solaris";
        case PrismVoice.LIRAEL: return "Lirael";
        case PrismVoice.MORGANA: return "Morgana";
        default: return "GG";
    }
}

/* =========================
   Sigil naming (chantable-ish)
   ========================= */

function prism_sigil_name_generate(tags) {
    var a = prism_sigil_pick_root(tags);
    var b = prism_sigil_pick_root(tags);
    var c = prism_sigil_pick_root(tags);

    if (irandom(1) == 0) return string_upper(a) + "-" + string_upper(b);
    return string_upper(a) + "-" + string_upper(b) + "-" + string_upper(c);
}

function prism_sigil_pick_root(tags) {
    var has_air = prism_tags_has(tags, "CALM");
    var has_spirit = prism_tags_has(tags, "SPIRIT");
    var has_restore = prism_tags_has(tags, "RESTORE");

    var bank = [];
    if (has_air) bank = prism_arr_concat(bank, ["anu", "ae", "sai", "wun"]);
    if (has_spirit) bank = prism_arr_concat(bank, ["um", "ora", "ely", "hu"]);
    if (has_restore) bank = prism_arr_concat(bank, ["ken", "ber", "lif", "dag"]);

    if (array_length_1d(bank) == 0) bank = ["sol", "tir", "rad", "sha", "per"];

    return bank[irandom(array_length_1d(bank) - 1)];
}

function prism_tags_has(tags, needle) {
    var n = array_length_1d(tags);
    for (var i = 0; i < n; i++) {
        if (tags[i] == needle) return true;
    }
    return false;
}

/* =========================
   Logging
   ========================= */

function prism_log_add(g, line) {
    ds_list_add(g.log, line);

    while (ds_list_size(g.log) > g.log_limit) {
        ds_list_delete(g.log, 0);
    }
}

/* =========================
   Rendering
